# Frozen documentation corpus

This directory holds the frozen Markdown corpus used by the RayuCode RAG
support assistant.

- Source repository: `Choeng-Rayu/rayu-web`
- Source commit: `486bab47797719a893e6aae9b9363460cd7f9cce`
- Copied date: `2026-11-10`
- Source directory: `public/docs/`

## Files

The 14 authoritative documents are:

```
01-installation.md
02-quickstart.md
03-providers.md
04-models.md
05-configuration.md
06-cli-reference.md
07-slash-commands.md
10-troubleshooting.md
15-api-keys.md
17-vscode-extension.md
18-subscription-plans.md
19-credits-and-limits.md
20-how-token-credit-charge.md
21-policies.md
```

`README.md` and `CHANGELOG.md` from the source repository were deliberately
excluded: this repository owns its own README, and the changelog is not part of
the support-docs corpus.

## Freeze policy

These files are **frozen**. Do not edit, reformat, or delete them. Any corpus
change must be a deliberate re-copy from a new pinned `rayu-web` commit, with
the source commit updated in this file and a fresh `prepare` + `verify` run so
the manifest hashes and the index `corpus_version` change together.

This README is intentionally named without a `.md` extension so that
`ls data/docs/*.md | wc -l` reports exactly the 14 corpus documents.
